cam-tools — P8 M-CAM0 camera acceptance tool (chase/free headless)
usage:
  cam-tools selftest [section]   run mechanical anchors (default: all)
  cam-tools cam-trace            dump the 150-frame chase scenario as TSV
  cam-tools cam-check <tsv>      re-verify a dumped cam-trace
  cam-tools free-trace           dump the 60-frame free-flight script as TSV
  cam-tools free-check <tsv>     re-verify a dumped free-trace
  cam-tools director-trace       dump the 90-frame mode-switch scenario as TSV
  cam-tools director-check <tsv> re-verify a dumped director-trace
  cam-tools cine-trace           dump the 90-frame cinematic playback as TSV
  cam-tools cine-check <tsv>     re-verify a dumped cine-trace
sections: init chase-a chase-b chase-c chase-d free-e director-f cine-g
exit codes: 0=PASS 1=failure 2=usage error
